# Repositories

All D1 access is in `src/lib/repositories/`. No SQL appears elsewhere in the codebase. Every function accepts `env: Env` as its last parameter and automatically injects `AND environment = ?`.

## Pattern

```typescript
// Every repository function follows this pattern:
export async function getEnquiryById(id: string, env: Env): Promise<Enquiry | null> {
  const db = getDB(env);
  const environment = getEnv(env);  // reads APP_ENV from env
  return one<Enquiry>(
    db.prepare('SELECT * FROM enquiries WHERE id = ? AND environment = ?')
      .bind(id, environment)
  );
}
```

## enquiries.ts

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `insertEnquiry(data, env)` | Creates a new enquiry |
| `getEnquiryById(id, env)` | Fetch by primary key |
| `getEnquiryByEmail(email, env)` | Duplicate detection |
| `listEnquiries(filters, env)` | Paginated list — status, search, limit, offset |
| `updateEnquiry(id, data, env)` | Partial update — note, processed, invite_id, age_group_id |
| `appendEnquiryEvent(id, event, env)` | Atomically appends to the JSON events array |

## invites.ts

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `createInviteForEnquiry(enquiryId, env)` | Creates invite with secure random token |
| `getInviteByToken(token, env)` | Primary lookup — used by booking page |
| `getInviteByEnquiryId(enquiryId, env)` | Find existing invite (for resend) |
| `markInviteSent / Accepted / Expired / Failed` | Status transitions |
| `incrementSendAttempts(id, error, env)` | Records failed send attempts |
| `listPendingInvites(env)` | Invites with status=pending and attempts < 3 |
| `listSentInvitesOlderThan(days, env)` | For the expire cron |

## bookings.ts

| Function | Purpose |
