| `listUnassignedWaitlist(env)` | Entries not yet assigned to a season |
| `getOpenAcademySeason(env)` | The current open season |
| `updateSeasonStatus(id, status, env)` | Season lifecycle transitions |
| `rolloverWaitlistEntry(entry, env)` | Resets for next season, sets is_returning |
| `hasAcceptedEntryForEnquiry(enquiryId, env)` | Detects returning athletes |

## D1 helpers (`src/lib/db/client.ts`)

```typescript
getDB(env)              // Returns env.DB — throws if missing
getEnv(env)             // Returns env.APP_ENV — defaults to 'production'
one<T>(stmt)            // Typed single-row fetch
many<T>(stmt)           // Typed multi-row fetch
run(stmt)               // Execute without return
generateId(prefix)      // e.g. generateId('enq') → 'enq_a3f8b2...'
generateToken(length)   // Cryptographically secure hex string
now()                   // Current UTC ISO string
```

